# GPQA-Diamond is a gated dataset (Idavidrein/gpqa). Access is conditional on
# never publishing problem text, options, answers, or model responses. Per-problem
# outputs already land under the ignored output/, but block the pattern outright
# so a `git add -f` or a stray path can't leak them. See data/README.md.
*gpqa*.jsonl
*gpqa*.json
**/gpqa_problems*

wandb/
*.pt
*.safetensors
*.bin
.venv/
.venv-vllm/
.venv-hrm/
tmp
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# experiments — keep configs/scripts, ignore downloaded weights + cloned upstream repos + logs
experiments/**/HRM-Text-1B/
experiments/**/HRM-Text-repo/
experiments/**/*.log
.claude/
